    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer PRIM_SIT_TARGET = 41;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant PRIM_SIT_TARGET has the value 41</p>
  <p>The sit target, if any defined for this prim. If the active value is 0 the sit target is deactivated. If it is nonzero the prim&#39;s sit target is set to the indicated offset and rotation. As with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlLinkSitTarget" target="_blank">llLinkSitTarget</a>(), these values are relative to the prim. However, unlike llLinkSitTarget() an offset of &lt;0.0, 0.0, 0.0&gt; may be explicitly set.</p>
</p>
    </div>

